## 5 · 🔒 IDENTITY AND SECURITY

| | |
|---|---|
| Founder | **the owner** — full identity in the private config, never hardcoded here |
| Master KEK | **always offline.** Never on the server |
| Plaintext secrets | **the owner never sees them** |
| Audit trail | immutable — no `UPDATE`, no `DELETE` |
| `Mente/secrets/` | 700, files 600, gitignored, **no `!README.md` exception** |
| Server / infra password | ⚠️ **declare your rotation policy here** — and the conditions that force a rotation before schedule (exposing a private network publicly, granting access to a new person, publishing any repo that could carry a transcript or a local settings file) 

